  "reason": "The two explicitly approved real sessions are consumed. One needed five MCP calls and one correctly rejected missing-primary_target input; the other met four calls/zero errors. The subsequent same-scope paired-target description correction has passed fresh model-free checks but has no final-candidate native qualification. Prepare a bounded TP renewal for deliberate human decision; no existing reply authorizes additional sessions.",
  "intended_change": "Reopen only TP to request exactly two additional fresh normal T7 sessions in one new explicitly bound cohort on the corrected final candidate. Preserve the spent original ledger, all successes/failures and unchanged UR/PRD/SD, guard, model/effort, task/prompt/parser/audit, call/error ceilings, account/spend and MCP/Copilot limits. Source revision permits only renewed planning/preparation; a fresh Approval: TP remains required before any model launch.",
