      "statement": "Exactly the same two unused sessions remain authorized; no additional/replacement session, resume or hidden retry.",
      "intended_change": "Declare those original two slots consumed and immutable. In a newly presented TP, request exactly two additional fresh gpt-6.1-sol/low sessions under a distinct one-cohort reservation, only after new deliberate TP approval and a fresh final-source guarded preflight. No automatic retry/resume/replacement, third session, old-source success transfer, changed native predicate or threshold is permitted.",
      "reason": "The approved two-session allowance is exhausted and cannot establish the PRD two-success minimum on the later corrected candidate. Further real execution changes this concrete planning allowance and needs explicit renewal; requirements and design remain unchanged."
    }
  ],
